{"change_summary":"Verified that the branch already contains the approved tanksim-6e5.6.3 molt/mineral fixes, so this apply-fixes pass was validation-only and required no additional source edits. I rechecked the relevant shrimp runtime/species wiring and reran focused and broad regression coverage; current HEAD passes the full `tank_core` suite plus downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` tests.","outstanding_risks":[],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current worktree and the relevant shrimp molt/mineral parameter, diagnostic, and regression paths to confirm there were no remaining review-requested fixes to apply on this branch.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reran focused regressions for molt/mineral behavior, validation, save/load, and reproduction-factor coverage, along with downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` suites.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the full `tank_core` test suite to confirm broader stability and recorded this stage as validation-only because no new code changes were needed.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short`","`git diff -- crates/tank_core/tests/reproduction_factors.rs`","`rg -n \"temp_condition_low_divisor_c|temp_condition_high_divisor_c|test_soft_vs_hard_water_shrimp_survival|MarginalFailure|critical_molt_gh_ratio\" crates/tank_core crates/tank_data crates/tank_scenarios`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test validation -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test reproduction_factors -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_data -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture`"]}